  "name": "chaingang",
  "description": "A collection of interactive audiovisual experiences and multiplayer generative games utilizing a custom entity-component-system and p5.js rendering. It features real-time state synchronization via Y-Sweet CRDTs, a modular audio engine for procedural synthesis, and a physics-driven interaction model based on Matter.js. The architecture supports complex narrative choreography and multi-layered post-processing effects within a browser environment.",
